Not every line is needed.
lines:
```python
class Node:
    def __init__(self, val, left=None, right=None):
        self.val = val
        self.left = left
        self.right = right

def floor(node, x):
    best = None
    while node is not None:
        if node.val == x:
            return x
        if node.val < x:
            best = node.val
            node = node.right
        else:
            node = node.left
    return best

root = Node(8, Node(3, Node(1), Node(6, Node(4), Node(7))), Node(10, None, Node(14, Node(13))))
print(floor(root, 5), floor(root, 12), floor(root, 0), floor(root, 7))
```
