```
hint: A value smaller than x could be the answer, but something bigger in its right subtree might be closer to x.
hint: Save it in `best` and go right. A value bigger than x can't be the answer: go left.
right: The walk only moves right after saving a candidate, so every later candidate is bigger than the one before. The last one saved is the floor: O(h).
wrong: Start with `best = None`. On a match, return x. If the node is smaller than x, save it and go right; otherwise go left. When the walk falls off the tree, `best` is the floor.
